R might not be installed on all compute nodes or else older version of R is installed and I want to use newer version of R (or vice versa).

With R + Hadoop streaming this is not a problem - one need to make an archive out of local R installation on local node, set some parameters  and ship this archive with Hadoop streaming job using "-archives" option (distributed cache).

Is it possible to accomplish the same with Rhipe? How to build Rhipe to make it ship local R archive to compute nodes?

--Konstantin

